<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="cfd82ee">&lt;p&gt;
    Determine the identities, responsibilities and decision rights of key stakeholders&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    The following table describes typical target audiences for the communication plan, along with their responsibilities:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table title=&quot;Stakeholders&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot; width=&quot;85%&quot; border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
    &lt;tbody&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot; abbr=&quot;&quot;&gt;
                Audience
            &lt;/th&gt;
            &lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot; abbr=&quot;&quot;&gt;
                Position
            &lt;/th&gt;
            &lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot; abbr=&quot;&quot;&gt;
                Description
            &lt;/th&gt;
            &lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot; abbr=&quot;&quot;&gt;
                Responsibilities
            &lt;/th&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Sponsor
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Internal
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Leads the group within client organization
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Hold ultimate responsibility for all communications within client organization
            &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Business Lead
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Internal
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Supports the projects within the client organization
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Support and drive the initiative within client area of responsibility
            &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Department Head
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Internal
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Leads the various departments within the client organization
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Support and drive the initiative within department
            &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Project Manager
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Internal
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Manages a project or operational activity within client organization
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Adopt newly introduced project management practices in most effective manner within project teams
            &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Board of Directors
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                External
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Oversees the strategic objectives of the client organization
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Overall strategic planning and decision making
            &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;</attribute>
