<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="6c95e52d">&lt;p&gt;
    Define topics to create awareness among stakeholders&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    Consider topics to communicate with stakeholders such as:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Scope definition (Project Charter)
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        WBS development
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Project scheduling
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Project estimation
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Communications planning
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Stakeholder identification
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Resource management
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Status reporting
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Risk, management
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Issue management
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Quality management
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Change control
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
