<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="999504d1">&lt;p&gt;
    Implement tools and techniques that will publicize processes and tools to project teams.&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    Consider a variety of tools and techniques to communicate effectively.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;table title=&quot;&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot; width=&quot;85%&quot; border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
    &lt;tbody&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot; abbr=&quot;&quot;&gt;
                Tools and Techniques
            &lt;/th&gt;
            &lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot; abbr=&quot;&quot;&gt;
                Description
            &lt;/th&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Presentations
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Face to face sessions coordinated and presented by specialized project personnel
            &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Training Sessions
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Formal training sessions conducted on relevant project areas
            &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Discussions
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Focus group discussions among small groups of staff members conducted by the project team members
            &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                E-mail or voicemail
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Concise messages provided to communicate project related reminders, information or concerns
            &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Newsletter
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                A periodic newsletter can be distributed on a regular basis to address a wide range of project issues,
                practices and topics for stakeholders
            &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Company website
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Utilize the client&apos;s company intranet to disseminate project awareness information, best practices and
                other documents, as well as provide up-to-date status on programs.&amp;nbsp; This is an optimum channel to post
                information of an immediate nature
            &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;</attribute>
