<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="fe504c3f">&lt;p&gt;
    Develop a communications calendar that will permit structured, regular dialog with key stakeholders regarding project
    performance.&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;br /&gt;
    The communication calendar documents communication methods (media), frequency and the target audience. It also
    designates the person(s) responsible for creating and delivering communications. The communications calendar is a
    “living” document that is revised according to project needs.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
